   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" type=\"1\" start=\"2\">\n    <li><span data-math=\"A(t)\">A(t)</span> is the average high temperature in Aspen, Colorado, <span data-math=\"t\">t</span> months after the start of the year. <span data-math=\"M(t)\">M(t)</span> is the average high temperature in Minneapolis, Minnesota, <span data-math=\"t\">t</span> months after the start of the year. Temperature is measured in degrees Fahrenheit.</li>\n</ol><br>    <p><img alt=\"\" class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom\" height=\"278\" src=\"exercises/media/331544afbbb7cb46.jpg\" width=\"300\"></p>\n    <p>Which function had the higher average rate of change between the beginning of January and middle of March?</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1333597,
     "content_html": "Aspen"
    },
    {
     "id": 1333598,
     "content_html": "Minneapolis"
